WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.151
"Are we there yet?" asked Lisa.

2
00:00:03.152 --> 00:00:05.782
"Almost," Mom replied.

3
00:00:05.783 --> 00:00:10.715
Lisa and Frank were driving with their parents to their grandparents’ house.

4
00:00:10.716 --> 00:00:13.684
"Oh, look!" said Frank.

5
00:00:13.685 --> 00:00:18.731
"Isn’t that the ice-cream shop that Grandpa likes to take us to?"

6
00:00:18.732 --> 00:00:21.684
"Yes, it is," said Mom.

7
00:00:21.685 --> 00:00:26.124
"It’s the same ice-cream shop I went to as a little girl."

8
00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:32.288
"It’s also the same place your mom worked in the summer of ’82," added their father.

9
00:00:32.289 --> 00:00:36.923
"Did you work at an ice-cream shop?" asked Frank.

10
00:00:36.924 --> 00:00:41.912
"Did you get to eat ice cream for free?" asked Lisa.

11
00:00:41.913 --> 00:00:44.985
"Yes, that’s right," said Mom.

12
00:00:44.986 --> 00:00:51.103
"I worked at the ice-cream shop for a summer, but the ice cream wasn’t free."

13
00:00:51.104 --> 00:00:56.655
"Look! There’s Grandma and Grandpa’s house!" Lisa shouted.

14
00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:59.873
Dad turned the car into Grandpa’s driveway.

15
00:00:59.874 --> 00:01:05.478
"Do you think Grandpa will take us out for ice cream now?" Lisa asked.

16
00:01:05.479 --> 00:01:10.215
"Not yet," Mom answered. "Ice cream is for dessert.

17
00:01:10.216 --> 00:01:14.251
He’ll take us to the ice-cream shop after dinner."

18
00:01:14.252 --> 00:01:17.248
Grandma came out of the house to greet them.

19
00:01:17.249 --> 00:01:22.404
"Oh, hi! Did you have a good trip?" she asked.

20
00:01:22.405 --> 00:01:27.007
"Yes, Grandma. Where’s Grandpa?" asked Frank.

21
00:01:27.008 --> 00:01:29.651
"Oh, he’s in the barn.

22
00:01:29.652 --> 00:01:33.503
He’ll be here soon," said Grandma.

23
00:01:33.504 --> 00:01:36.068
Just then Grandpa joined them.

24
00:01:36.069 --> 00:01:41.395
"Grandpa!" Lisa shouted as she ran to him.

25
00:01:41.396 --> 00:01:45.317
"Have you been a good girl?" asked Grandpa.

26
00:01:45.318 --> 00:01:48.156
"Oh, yes," said Lisa.

27
00:01:48.157 --> 00:01:54.827
"Mommy told me that I had to be good or else you wouldn’t take us out for ice cream."

28
00:01:54.828 --> 00:02:01.724
"That’s right. Only good girls and boys get to have ice cream," Grandpa said, smiling.

29
00:02:01.725 --> 00:02:07.397
"Are you hungry?" asked Grandma. "Dinner is almost ready.

30
00:02:07.398 --> 00:02:13.336
After you take everything upstairs, come to the dining room."

31
00:02:13.337 --> 00:02:17.069
After dinner everyone praised Grandma’s cooking.

32
00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:20.658
"Thank you. That was excellent," said Dad.

33
00:02:20.659 --> 00:02:24.059
"I agree," said Grandpa.

34
00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:29.501
"I think it’s time for . . . ice cream!" shouted Lisa.

35
00:02:29.502 --> 00:02:36.897
"Yes," said Grandpa, smiling. "Ice cream is my favorite dessert."

36
00:02:36.898 --> 00:02:41.209
"Then let’s go for ice cream!" said Frank.

37
00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:44.290
"Can we go now?" said Lisa.

38
00:02:44.291 --> 00:02:47.338
"Lisa, Frank," said Mom.

39
00:02:47.339 --> 00:02:54.083
"First we need to help Grandma clean up the dishes, and then we’ll go and get ice cream."

40
00:02:54.084 --> 00:02:57.918
"Okay, Mom," Lisa and Frank replied.

41
00:02:57.919 --> 00:03:02.440
With Lisa and Frank’s help, the kitchen was soon clean.

42
00:03:02.441 --> 00:03:05.755
"We’re finished!" shouted Lisa.

43
00:03:05.756 --> 00:03:09.873
"Are we taking two cars?" asked Frank.

44
00:03:09.874 --> 00:03:16.103
"No. We’re going to ride in the back of your grandpa’s truck," said their father.

45
00:03:16.104 --> 00:03:18.649
"Really?" shouted Frank.

46
00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:21.722
"Yes, really," said Grandpa.

47
00:03:21.723 --> 00:03:26.439
"But there will be no standing and no sticking your hands outside the truck."

48
00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:29.865
Before long, they arrived at the ice-cream shop.

49
00:03:29.866 --> 00:03:33.820
"What kind of ice cream do you want?" asked Grandpa.

50
00:03:33.821 --> 00:03:38.331
"I want two scoops of chocolate chip," said Frank.

51
00:03:38.332 --> 00:03:42.408
"I want three scoops!" shouted Lisa.

52
00:03:42.409 --> 00:03:46.884
"Lisa," Mom said. "Two scoops."

53
00:03:46.885 --> 00:03:53.404
"Okay, two scoops. One black raspberry and the other mint chocolate chip."

54
00:03:53.405 --> 00:03:57.938
Grandpa paid, and everyone got their ice cream.

55
00:03:57.939 --> 00:04:02.384
"Look, Mom! My ice-cream cone looks like the sign,"

56
00:04:02.385 --> 00:04:07.525
said Lisa, pointing at the large ice-cream cone outside the shop.

57
00:04:07.526 --> 00:04:15.712
"I’ve got three scoops—chocolate, black raspberry, and mint chocolate chip."

58
00:04:15.713 --> 00:04:20.366
"I said two scoops, Lisa," said Mom, annoyed.

59
00:04:20.367 --> 00:04:25.599
"I said it was okay as long as we share," said Grandpa.

60
00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:29.913
"Thanks Grandpa," said Lisa. She smiled.

61
00:04:29.914 --> 00:04:32.591
Sharing with Grandpa was fun.

